AIM:To develop a user-defined package in Java and use it from a class placed outside that package.
Algorithm:
Algorithm
1. Start.
2. Create MathUtil.java beginning with the line package com.scsvmv.util;
3. Mark the class and its methods public.
4. Compile it with javac -d . MathUtil.java so the folders are created.
5. Create UseMath.java in the top folder and import com.scsvmv.util.MathUtil;
6. Compile and run UseMath from the top folder.
7.stop
Program 2.1 — MathUtil.java (7 lines)
// File: MathUtil.java (the package member)
package com.scsvmv.util;
public class MathUtil {
public static int square(int n) { return n * n; }
public static int cube(int n) { return n * n * n; }
}
Program 2.2 — UseMath.java (9 lines)
